The RN104 is built upon the Mar[vell] ARMADA 370 platform, clocked at 1.2 GHz, with 512MB of memory to accompany it. Across the front of the unit, we have four 3.5" drive trays that support tool-less installation. Total storage capacity is listed at 16TB, with dual gig[abit] LAN ports at the rear of the unit.
